


'''
K- Nearest Neighbors
--------------------------
-> Does both classification and regression tasks
->Lazy Algorithm 

Formula
-----------------------
-> Euclidian Distance(root(x2-x1)2 + (y2-y1)2)'''



#What to find? 
''' -> Optimal number of k (neighbor)
k = 3
